    <!-- How It Works Section -->
    <section class="mb-16 sm:mb-20">
      <div class="w-full mb-8">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#87b2f4] font-medium mb-1.5">
          How it works
        </h2>
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-[#090a0f] leading-snug">
          Everything you need to write, test, and ship code.
        </h3>
        <div class="mt-3 space-y-2.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-[#52525b] leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            December runs directly inside your local repository. It understands your codebase, plans multi-file changes, edits code with precision, and executes shell commands and test suites to verify every fix.
          </p>
          <p>
            Bring the tools and subscriptions you already have: December connects seamlessly to your existing plans, including Claude Code, Codex plan, Antigravity plan, and Copilot plan. It also supports 150+ model providers via BYOK and fully offline local models with Ollama.
          </p>
          <p>
            Need cloud compute or live browser previews? Simply type <code class="font-mono text-[#090a0f]">/handoff</code> to move any local terminal session into an isolated cloud sandbox for instant collaboration and visual verification.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

